<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian security forces killed two of their own personnel during an operation against an ISIS-linked cell near Damascus and the Lebanese border. Israeli forces conducted a raid in southern Syria that killed a Syrian man with Down syndrome in Daraa. Jordan and Syria met to stress territorial integrity and reject Israeli attacks on southern Syria while discussing strategic projects. Returnees from the Sare Kani area reported difficulties reclaiming property as security forces increase evictions. The conflict has caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPREFDTmNYTXJhX2tQdV93OXZRbmoyRnJGVkF0VEtzRXlkNUNDYk15cGpFNHd0YXBqUXA2VGhfdkdKSXRRdHVXb0dUaXR6R3hUY05qWjJhbFUyMzBMYU43dU9GUkhmYl9YbmM3YjRzQmJGTzJPMWo0VXJHV2R6cG1xMXNmSjluM2ViX2lxWGtxYUtRWm9oa19BT2R0WHMzMlMtNU0zUVcxTjZidGFDbWg3d1pQdWI1clRwMFYzVTQyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQRDU3RjZHeUdNamdBUEs1MEVXazNYSk1rU3JoSXRFTmx3T25zNzl5TnpLZ2ZhUUpHc05ZbUdOLWhZa1pNR3VDVWVDVzRaM3BZT3IxSUpTWXFWbkpMVG92NmhFVWpBYjJ0ck1xTVdvS2tncm1ZeVJ1aWRVejRTaEd6eHVOd1B0czlpcDBvWDd3azllOG8zeHVuaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Arabiya English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPQjdaSHRaSnFqWmZNemVuLWZNMzRXSjNETU5vY1d0SWFuRzNNb2tRSzVhUlk3cGYyNWQ1bURyVjJyS2F0cjdyMW1OTmtvQUdDZzNkNHJwWFFaa0M5SWp4MFBxMEVzODFfZHg2ZHdFSVAtQUUyQ09yYzA1am9PbFUxWFBDaFNxeHpzQTk5N0hXbExDeEx4SGVvUkl4RQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News